kappa(n) = 1 + C(n-2,2)  vs  info-floor ceil(log2 A000568)  vs  naive m=C(n-1,2):
  n=3: kappa=  1  info-floor=1  naive m=  1  (m-kappa = n-3 = 0;  kappa=m(n-1)+1)
  n=4: kappa=  2  info-floor=2  naive m=  3  (m-kappa = n-3 = 1;  kappa=m(n-1)+1)
  n=5: kappa=  4  info-floor=4  naive m=  6  (m-kappa = n-3 = 2;  kappa=m(n-1)+1)
  n=6: kappa=  7  info-floor=6  naive m= 10  (m-kappa = n-3 = 3;  kappa=m(n-1)+1)
  n=7: kappa= 11  info-floor=9  naive m= 15  (m-kappa = n-3 = 4;  kappa=m(n-1)+1)
  n=8: kappa= 16  info-floor=None  naive m= 21  (m-kappa = n-3 = 5;  kappa=m(n-1)+1)

